lt emboldened and free enough  to treat her like an object  anyway do you think that that particular  fact pattern  can sort of pierce through  um some of this  uh  need for culture shift i think that's  one of the examples in the report that  stands out to me  well all i can say is  there is there there's been a cultural  shift and it's come into the juries uh  uh in civil cases and also in criminal  cases  uh in civil cases for example we see the  metoo movement having a huge impact  uh in a very famous sexual harassment  case that our law firm tried in 2019  where we sued a billionaire on behalf of  one victim of sexual harassment  and we won a verdict from a jury of 58  million  250 000  for one victim of sexual harassment uh  motion for new trial denied so a jury  was very very much in support of our  client in that case and for a different  victim of the same billionaire whose  name is alky david a few months earlier  our law firm tried another case and a  different jury awarded more than 5  million dollars to yet another victim of  sexual harassment in the criminal  uh area as well we saw harvey weinstein  in new york convicted  of  criminal sexual assault against  my client mimi haley who was the key  victim in the  criminal case in new york and he was  convicted of criminal sexual assault  against her and sentenced to 20 years  just on that charge alone  and then three or more years for another  victim of sexual harassment so  many years ago district attorneys would  never file criminal cases under these  facts and circumstances now  they  have made a judgment that they have a  chance of proving beyond a reasonable  doubt to a jury  that a person who is a predator who's  er  is going to convict if the right  evidence is uh is demonstrated to them  and admitted in court of law  so there definitely is an important  shift not only generationally not only  culturally  but now  into the legal sphere as well and what  does that all mean  means that governor cuomo has a lot to  fear about what may happen  even before his resignation i love after  his resignation  i love how you explain the impact of the  culture shift on juries and also um in  the civil and criminal context i think  that's extremely important for folks to  understand we're not just you know doing  culture shift for for the fun of it  uh there are important uh consequences  as a result gloria allred thank you so  much for joining me tonight and please  stay safe  hi i'm zerlina maxwell thanks for  checking out our channel on youtube you  can see more from zerlina by clicking  any of the videos on this screen and  make sure you subscribe below to stay up  to date on the day's biggest stories  thanks for watching
 

